      0 & 0 & {1\text{/}3}
      \end{bmatrix}$$Show that this factorization is useful when computing high powers of $A$ Find fairly simple formulas for $A^{2}$, $A^{3}$, and $A^{k}$ ($k$ a positive integer), using $P$ and the entries in $D$.﻿
